[{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其八","author":"陈镒","text":"处世无为富贵酣，急流勇退是奇男。\n悠然自在樊笼外，闲对江山雪满簪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17836,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其九","author":"陈镒","text":"我今老矣守林泉，破屋萧然一榻悬。\n每向秋宵看月色，怀人千里共婵娟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17837,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十","author":"陈镒","text":"猗绿亭前竹满林，纷纷苍雪落层阴。\n开轩载诵清风句，岁晚宁忘故旧心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17838,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十一","author":"陈镒","text":"昔曾游览遍山川，汎汎身如不系船。\n今日栖迟茅屋下，却怜多病对云眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17839,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十二","author":"陈镒","text":"门外清溪水气寒，喜无尘俗事相干。\n重阳谁共尊中酒，忍见黄花白露漙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17840,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十三","author":"陈镒","text":"山深五月啭黄鹂，秋到惟闻乌夜啼。\n欲寄相思无便使，空吟短句付诗奚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17841,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十四","author":"陈镒","text":"贫病真同涸辙鱼，浇愁幸有酒堪沽。\n秋来诗骨饶清健，自喜登高不用扶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17842,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉和刘伯温员外漫兴诗韵并自述一十五首 其十五","author":"陈镒","text":"秋水溶溶绿一湾，青山叠叠白云闲。\n而今不作功名念，容我逍遥山水间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17843,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"碧树参差竹屋低，半生此地惬幽栖。\n悠然不尽登临兴，屋上青山屋下溪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17844,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"红尘吹不到溪堂，时掬清泠沃酒肠。\n山外乱鸦飞过尽，数声渔笛晚风凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17845,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其三","author":"陈镒","text":"径竹猗猗昼掩门，日移清影过芳尊。\n午香一炷闲无事，坐看幽禽下树根。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17846,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其四","author":"陈镒","text":"一笑归来避世纷，山灵不用勒移文。\n白云本自无心出，我况如今懒似云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17847,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其五","author":"陈镒","text":"十载缁尘染客衣，田园今喜赋来归。\n此身与物同闲适，倦翮孤云自在飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17848,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其六","author":"陈镒","text":"溪头拟结野翁亭，更种溪傍万竹青。\n白发一尊聊自遣，夜深时看老人星。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17849,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其七","author":"陈镒","text":"穷檐阴合翳松萝，迎送都无白玉珂。\n从此只知田野事，山人溪叟日相过。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17850,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其八","author":"陈镒","text":"渊明归隐成疏懒，谩自题诗责五男。\n三径盘桓有馀乐，葛巾牢裹弃缨簪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17851,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其九","author":"陈镒","text":"残年饱饭独怡然，陋室从教似罄悬。\n剩喜绕阶多竹色，晚来新月斗婵娟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17852,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十","author":"陈镒","text":"一区旧宅带秋林，占断溪南十亩阴。\n长日坐分鸥鹭席，㗳然忘我亦忘心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17853,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十一","author":"陈镒","text":"秋风吹绿涨晴川，老去生涯一钓船。\n人世烟尘犹眯目，争如沙上共鸥眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17854,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十二","author":"陈镒","text":"矍哉陋儿笑儒寒，微禄资身已懒干。\n手种园中千树橘，黄金颗颗露漙漙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17855,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十三","author":"陈镒","text":"百亩新承溪上堰，年荒幸免为饥啼。\n举家从此无忧色，却笑涪翁悯跛奚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17856,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十四","author":"陈镒","text":"买得渔家一尺鱼，床头酒熟不须沽。\n三杯饮罢斜阳里，行看青山信杖扶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17857,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"借漫兴一十五首 其十五","author":"陈镒","text":"溪上幽居无限好，天分地位颇宽闲。\n我生本是疏慵者，只合渔樵老此间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17858,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其一","author":"陈镒","text":"乱世艰难寄此身，暮年食蓼有馀辛。\n一春胜事成虚掷，空忆兰亭王右军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17859,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其二","author":"陈镒","text":"碧山深处息兵戈，石窦甘泉冷齿牙。\n绝似天台旧风景，何人能复饭胡麻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17860,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其三","author":"陈镒","text":"林树深深石径斜，野桥村坞两三家。\n萧条门巷人行少，惟见疏桐自落花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17861,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其四","author":"陈镒","text":"功名老去念头轻，尽日看山眼倍明。\n甚欲买田为隐计，囊空未办孔方兄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17862,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其五","author":"陈镒","text":"睡起书斋日正中，松花飘粉满房栊。\n山童颇解诗翁意，茶灶犹藏宿火红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17863,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其六","author":"陈镒","text":"一溪流水绕山隈，岸草青青长旧荄。\n鸥鸟不知人事异，自随钓艇去还回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17864,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵吴学录春日山中杂兴七首 其七","author":"陈镒","text":"故老相逢竹外村，能谈旧史忆乾元。\n大儿昨日从军去，惆怅无人给晓昏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17865,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其一 翠屏晚对","author":"陈镒","text":"为爱群山列翠屏，竹门终日不曾扃。\n溪风吹却白云去，添得他山一抹青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17866,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其二 绿野春耕","author":"陈镒","text":"雨足田畴春水生，青阳浮处有农耕。\n村南村北秧初绿，布谷树头相对鸣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17867,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其三 月浦泛舟","author":"陈镒","text":"与客携壶夜泛舟，水光不动月光浮。\n洞箫吹彻湖山静，应似坡仙赤壁游。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17868,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其四 雪溪垂钓","author":"陈镒","text":"水阔天寒雪正飞，渔翁犹在水之湄。\n凭谁画出溪头景，蓑笠孤舟独钓时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17869,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其五 竹楼清眺","author":"陈镒","text":"竹外登楼兴自豪，纷纷苍雪冷吟袍。\n浮云吹尽秋空阔，独鹤归来山月高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17870,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其六 松岭早行","author":"陈镒","text":"松林曙色未全分，半入青山半入云。\n落叶钟声何处寺，行人疑在梦中闻。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17871,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其七 古寺钟声","author":"陈镒","text":"隔溪古寺夕阳时，风送钟声落翠微。\n想见老僧归院晚，山童未掩白云扉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17872,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其八 平川霁色","author":"陈镒","text":"渺渺平湖荡日光，渔烟起处隔沧浪。\n登楼有客看秋霁，杨柳风多满袖凉。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17873,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其九 西山牧笛","author":"陈镒","text":"西山山下草离离，断陇平坡雨过时。\n牛背牧儿归路晚，数声短笛倚风吹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17874,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题湖山十景 其十 东岸渔灯","author":"陈镒","text":"月黑楼前湖水明，渔灯点点过沙汀。\n芦风忽起光还灭，疑是寒宵夜燐青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17875,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"道径东岩砦","author":"陈镒","text":"荒村寂寞两三家，故垒东边石径斜。\n岩树不知人死尽，春来还发旧时花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17876,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠别周善长之金华","author":"陈镒","text":"风捲山云雪乍晴，又携书卷促行程。\n知君此去双溪上，一路梅花管送迎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17877,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋夜读书感怀","author":"吴景奎","text":"宵中风雨除，明蟾界心房。\n秋堂湛虚白，飞露生浮凉。\n夜气之所存，澹然思虑忘。\n短檠对方册，一览四五行。\n注目曾未久，玄花眩幽光。\n瞳子罹哀酸，蹙额攒清扬。\n愤嫌书字细，频挑灯烬长。\n远睇觉暂明，迫观愈微茫。\n掩卷重太息，惊心怛中肠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17878,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"喻鸠","author":"吴景奎","text":"东村五亩园，荒秽久不治。\n荷锄种豆苗，爱此膏土肥。\n森然已甲坼，保之若婴儿。\n群鸠竞拂羽，俯啄思无遗。\n傍麾虽稍却，投閒复在兹。\n一啄不汝惜，再啄苗已稀。\n剜我心上肉，充汝肠中饥。\n汝饥诚可怜，矰?那忍施。\n桑林正沃若，桑椹方垂垂。\n椹熟可醉饱，林深无危机。\n恩怨从此释，斯园勿重窥。\n鸠鸣对心臆，群然亦高飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17879,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"采菊","author":"吴景奎","text":"爽气浮西山，风烟澹原隰。\n悠然出衡门，佳节逢九日。\n众草萋以青，黄菊正秋色。\n采之不盈把，妙意良自得。\n谓能制颓龄，可泛忘忧物。\n驩言命壶觞，万事付酣适。\n永怀东篱人，俯仰已陈迹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17880,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其一 正月","author":"吴景奎","text":"曲尘丝拂晴波暖，霁霭空濛烧痕浅。\n含章宫中万玉妃，粉花点额芳霏霏。\n条风东来初解冻，蝴蝶吹醒花底梦。\n翠鬟梳罢玉纤寒，綵燕衔春上金凤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17881,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其二 二月","author":"吴景奎","text":"青皇宫中花鸟使，沓翠霏红教莺语。\n移春槛小度芳华，金犊车轻载歌舞。\n曲房梦断章台月，东风不解丁香结。\n钥鱼夜守仓琅根，海棠飞落胭脂雪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17882,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其三 三月","author":"吴景奎","text":"紫箫吹月梨花老，碧云冉冉迷芳草。\n药栏茧栗怯春寒，翠帐流苏护莺晓。\n丽人一去音尘杳，泪洒红绡怨青鸟。\n新蒲细柳自年年，曲江流恨波声小。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17883,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其四 四月","author":"吴景奎","text":"轻红流烟香雨足，新槐影转构栏曲。\n水晶帘箔度薰风，簧吻乌衣语华屋。\n凉簪坠发初破睡，粉痕浅护修蛾绿。\n并禽不受雕笼宿，背人飞向荷阴浴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17884,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其五 五月","author":"吴景奎","text":"网轩绿艾悬飞虎，菖蒲花青海榴吐。\n江娥倚竹弄湘弦，调笑怀沙怨兰杜。\n南薰生凉纨扇薄，雕俎瑶觞劝郎酌。\n綵索光浮系臂纱，守宫红映黄金约。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17885,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其六 六月","author":"吴景奎","text":"冰山珑璁间瑶席，水拍银盘漱寒碧。\n象床湘簟含风漪，腻香粉汗沾凝脂。\n赤帝啾啾火龙老，琪树西风转昏晓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17886,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其七 七月","author":"吴景奎","text":"凤凰枝头一叶飞，碧疏朱缀生凉飔。\n素纨团团恩爱衰，含宫嚼羽吹参差。\n瑶阶露华沾履綦，星桥月帐愁别离，粉筵欢笑占蛛丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17887,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其八 八月","author":"吴景奎","text":"蘋风夕起凉思多，新愁旧恨生浓蛾。\n云兜鷾鸸返故国，瑶阶络纬鸣寒莎。\n铜仙泓泓泣零露，银湾漾漾吹凉波。\n素娥徘徊白鸾舞，广庭老树今如何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17888,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其九 九月","author":"吴景奎","text":"黄金花开香满把，烟草荒台谁戏马。\n楚云栉栉雁西流，秋色悽人正潇洒。\n泪花蔌蔌啼新愁，缠弦五色弹箜篌。\n宝香不暖茱萸帐，明月空过翡翠楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17889,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其十 十月","author":"吴景奎","text":"小春一花西月黄，缟衣美人吹暗香。\n锦衾罗荐晓寒薄，梦中持赠双明珰。\n霜花莫洒相思树，愁杀孤栖金凤凰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17890,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其十一 十一月","author":"吴景奎","text":"八姨手持榑桑枝，海天冻合青玻瓈。\n琼楼仙人唤滕六，夜入银潢剪瑛琭。\n沈香火暖锦承尘，叵罗羔酒生春粼。\n宫沟不寄题红怨，日映五纹添弱线。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17891,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其十二 十二月","author":"吴景奎","text":"琼芳销歇年华改，青鸟无音隔瑶海。\n绿绡窗户弄晴曦，柳条迎腊含烟彩。\n上苑花须连夜开，枝头休剪杨家綵。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17892,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟李长吉十二月乐辞 其十三 闰月","author":"吴景奎","text":"若华煌煌萦日驭，气朔盈虚积馀数。\n低鬟敛黛拜孀娥，孤负团圆十三度。\n生物趋功得岁长，山中独厄黄杨树。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17893,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送日者黄学海归江西","author":"吴景奎","text":"黄君旧饮西江水，太华黄河归眼底。\n移家直上黄金台，袖染天香五云里。\n神游碧落鞭雷霆，六丁呵护青囊经。\n蓝袍掩映苍水佩，剑光倒射天冥冥。\n前身金华老仙伯，此生还作金华客。\n却厌缁尘点客衣，解组竟寻山水癖。\n生男有室女有家，买田筑室栽桑麻。\n秋风吹醒故园梦，清江碧嶂天之涯。\n去路不辞烟水隔，骨肉相欢头雪白。\n千年老鹤今来归，閤皂山前令威宅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17894,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"故园多海棠其一树大数十围树顶一枝如雪白因赋","author":"吴景奎","text":"太真酒酣睡未足，深宫已纵衔花鹿。\n翠华一夜拂峨嵋，风尘澒洞黄金屋。\n马嵬香土埋婵娟，冶容悔与春争妍。\n似闻天王狩太白，雪魄幻作花中仙。\n澹妆独立东风里，冷笑漫山旧桃李。\n芳心恨不聘梅花，雨中有泪如铅水。\n蜀山紫锦同本根，得如梨雪聊相温。\n凝脂酝藉初出浴，玉凫波暖春粼粼。\n瑶台月下相逢处，翠袖冰姿生媚妩。\n更烧银烛醉中看，髣髴《霓裳羽衣》舞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17895,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五十自讼示同志","author":"吴景奎","text":"嗟我行年今五十，鬓毛半染秋霜白。\n方知四十九年非，追数生平竟何益。\n少年懒惰废经史，明时进取无谋画。\n临财不解竞锥刀，饱食安知勤稼穑。\n故园已荒松菊径，索居却占渔樵席。\n陆沉井里等樗散，宾饯羲娥驶驹隙。\n齿牙摇落筋力疲，两目生花眩朱碧。\n母年七帙馀四龄，饮食康强喜愉怿。\n大儿无成小儿幼，有弟相望念离隔。\n弱孙绕膝不识愁，弄笔摊书恣狼藉。\n不如意事十八九，俯仰兴怀百忧积。\n敢随佻巧人共嗤，自信修姱心不易。\n使予浸假嗜酣酗，好勇斗狠从博弈。\n岂如用拙乐贱贫，清苦宁辞食冰蘖。\n牛衣不暖泣中夜，犊鼻凄凉徒四壁。\n丈夫未遇亦如此，顾我何为叹纬繣。\n已将穷达付天公，啸歌起视沧溟窄。\n方今忽忽岁遒尽，黄落山林见松柏。\n揆余初度安足论，母恩未报嗟穷厄。\n醉来聊以写我忧，返锁衡门谢宾客。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17896,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"中秋对月","author":"吴景奎","text":"素娥游宴清虚府，手摘蟾花啖寒兔。\n琼楼高处作中秋，净洗银盘浥风露。\n此时令我忆去年，山中桂影浮觥船。\n今年却来江海上，美人千里同婵娟。\n世间忧乐知多少，天地无穷月长好。\n明年踪迹何处看，此夜阴晴亦难保。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17897,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鹊有媒","author":"吴景奎","text":"长林萧萧两乾鹊，牖户绸缪欣有托。\n雄飞望望杳不归，饮啄应怜堕矰缴。\n孀雌哺鷇成孤栖，月明不复从南飞。\n迢迢织女隔银浦，风多巢冷将畴依。\n花间双鹊能凸喜，来往殷勤道芳意。\n雄鸠佻巧鸩不媒，愿得灵脩几同类。\n斯须众鹊邀提壶，入林绕树声相呼。\n群飞尽弃遗一鹊，同室定偶携诸孤。\n彊彊和鸣如有道，求牡深惭雉鸣鷕。\n踰墙钻穴相窥从，重叹人而不如鸟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17898,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"癸未春留钱唐巨可大家六月可大殁明年移家临平余将东归因赋此写怀","author":"吴景奎","text":"去年六月十五夜，月明渔浦看潮生。\n今年此夜对明月，凄凉池馆难为情。\n故人梦断知何处，生存华屋含风露。\n明朝家具载扁舟，又向临平山下住。\n忆昔故人邀我来，笑谈白日驱风雷。\n百年未半忽转烛，时移事改令人哀。\n我家金华北山北，堂上慈亲年八十。\n要知生死见交情，两载淹留归未得。\n孤儿有托女有归，余亦兴怀歌式微。\n悲来纵笔写情曲，九原杳杳心相知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":17899,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]